{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/12388-homebrew-touchstones","id":12388,"title":"Homebrew Touchstones","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-16T17:28:00-08:00","id":12388,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Homebrew Touchstones","content":"I have designed two.<br /> <br /> One is The Pillar. It can be found in such things as the Space Needle to the Washington Monument to any number of obelisks all over the world. I have made it where, when you go to The Pillar itself, then you can find the backdoor to any Overworld. You would be able to head to your own with much greater ease than another's...but the option is there.<br /> <br /> The other is The Library. The special thing for it is that all dice rolled on a research roll comes up as successes. Additionally, you can make a Legend roll and then you can gain the answer to one question per success as long as the answer to the question has been recorded.<br /> <br /> Are these too overpowered? Does anyone have any opinions on them? Also, does anyone else have any others that they wish to share?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T17:42:59-08:00","id":12397,"title":"","content":"I would also have a minimum requirement roll for the Library, or complete idiots would have an easier time than the unlucky scion of Athena with six dots of Arete: Academics.<br /> They are rather cool, though.<br /> <br /> For a scion in my game, trying to become the &quot;god of competition,&quot; I have set up the Olympic flame as a touchstone that takes you to the base of Mount Olympus. They souls of Gold-Medalists go there, like some sport-themed Valhalla.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1011-phgraves","name":"PHGraves","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1011_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T19:58:27-08:00","id":12458,"title":"","content":"Here's a bunch of them! This includes new spins and additions to the canon Touchstones, and a bunch of fan-written Touchstones.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1whByo0m932dgRbTAYT-1GP06ddesdG8ogcG02uD72sQ/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Touchstones Google Doc</b></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T22:26:04-08:00","id":12523,"title":"","content":"Thanks Graves for the input. I will go ahead and think about some minimums since I have one guy who is a sniper/hacker/chemist/weapons engineer/occultist who is really good with research. And yes, I have told him to go ahead and get some dots in Performance so that he can go full Buckaroo Banzai...lol.<br /> <br /> I will save that document, Telgar. I like tweaking my campaign and chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},